From: OpenMandriva
Subject: [PATCH] Bug 2054387 - Thunderbird: Qt shell service, themes, and mailnews wiring

Port the remaining Thunderbird-specific pieces for cairo-qt:
- nsQtShellService (default mail/news/rss/calendar client via xdg-*)
- Stub nsGNOMEShellService_GetGSettingsBoolean for Rust sys_tray DND check
- Linux theme for Qt (mail + calendar)
- HAVE_SHELL_SERVICE and nsUserInfoUnix for qt
- Build/register shell service under MOZ_WIDGET_TOOLKIT=qt

